Treat price and position as a point-in-time result, not a measure of product sales or campaign performance. serp_url opens current Google Shopping results for the observed keyword and market; it is not a replay of the saved capture. When a saved image is available, image_url points to the private REST image endpoint and requires a credential authorized for the REST API; an OAuth token scoped to MCP cannot fetch it. image_app_url opens the image for a signed-in account member. Both fields are null if no image was saved. captures counts saved Shopping captures, captures_unavailable those where Shopping data could not be read, products the listings across the whole selection. data_state separates no captures (no data), captures that were all unavailable (no product count can be inferred) and captures with no sponsored products (a real zero). Available on plans that include Shopping; otherwise plan_required.","tags":["Reports"],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":253,"description":"The project: its id, its brand domain (for example nike.example) or its exact project or brand name. Unknown or ambiguous references return not_found; call list_projects then."},"description":"The project: its id, its brand domain (for example nike.example) or its exact project or brand name. Unknown or ambiguous references return not_found; call list_projects then."},{"name":"range","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["7d","14d","30d","12m","custom"],"description":"Window ending today: 7d, 14d, 30d (default) or 12m. Use custom with from and to for fixed dates."},"description":"Window ending today: 7d, 14d, 30d (default) or 12m. Use custom with from and to for fixed dates."},{"name":"from","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","description":"First local day, YYYY-MM-DD (custom range)."},"description":"First local day, YYYY-MM-DD (custo