 included, YYYY-MM-DD."},"time_zone":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"string","description":"Inclusive start instant, ISO 8601."},"end":{"type":"string","description":"Exclusive end instant, ISO 8601."}},"additionalProperties":false,"required":["from","to","time_zone","start","end"]},"request_id":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false,"required":["domain","data","total","next_cursor","truncated","window"]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error400"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error401"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error403"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error404"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error409"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error429"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error503"}}}},"/projects/{project_id}/ad-copy-changes":{"get":{"operationId":"list_ad_copy_changes","summary":"Recent ad copy changes across advertisers","description":"Lists new ad copy versions first observed in the window for any advertiser on the project's monitored searches, newest first, each with the version it followed and a word-level diff. Use the changes to brief the SEM team on messaging and offers that appeared in monitored results. Observed creative changes do not show which version performed better; the tool measures what appeared in saved checks, not clicks or conversions. The same list as the Ad copy changes page. first_seen is when monitoring first observed the copy, not when the advertiser launched it. To tell a new version from an old one, up to 90 days before the window are also read. A copy change is not evidence of a policy issue.","tags":["Reports"],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":253,"description":"The project: its id, its brand domain (for example nike.example) or its exact project or brand name. Unknown or ambiguous references return not_found; call list_projects then."},"description":"The project: its id, its brand 