"description":"The project: its id, its brand domain (for example nike.example) or its exact project or brand name. Unknown or ambiguous references return not_found; call list_projects then."}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"x-required-scope":"read","x-mcp-tool":"list_policy_rules","responses":{"200":{"description":"A project's policy rules","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"project_id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"type":{"type":"string","enum":["forbidden_terms","brand_term","direct_linking","promo_code","position_limit","affiliate_id"]},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"readable":{"type":"boolean","description":"False when the stored configuration no longer parses; such a rule is skipped."},"params":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"terms":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":100},"maxItems":50,"description":"Forbidden words or phrases."},"fields":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["headline","description","display_url"]},"maxItems":3,"description":"Ad parts to check for terms."},"applies_to":{"type":"string","enum":["unauthorized","all_non_owned"]},"authorized_domains":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":253},"maxItems":50},"extra_terms":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":100},"maxItems":20,"description":"Extra brand terms."},"codes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":20},"maxItems":50,"description":"Forbidden promo codes."},"any_explicit_code":{"type":"boolean","description":"Also flag any other code written after the word code."},"allowed_codes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":20},"maxItems":50},"top_positions":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":10},"authorized_ids":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":256},"maxItems":200}},"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Parameters for the rule type; send only the ones that type uses."},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Parameters for the rule type; send only the ones that type uses."},"scope":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"engine":{"anyOf":[{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},{"type":"null"}]},"device":{"anyOf":[{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},{"type":"null"}]},"os":{"anyOf":[{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},{"type":"null"}]},"country":{"anyOf":[{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},{"type":"null"}]},"location":{"anyOf":[{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},{"type":"null"}]}},"additionalProperties":false,"required":["engine","device","os","country","location"],"description":"Which observations the rule checks. null in a dimension means every value; values within a dimension combine with OR, dimensions with AND."},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Which observations the rule checks. null in a dimension means every value; values within a dimension combine with OR, dimensions with AND."},"open_cases":{"type":"integer"},"created_at":{"type":"string"},"updated_at":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","project_id","name","type","enabled","readable","params","scope","open_cases","created_at","updated_at"]}},"request_id":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false,"required":["data"]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error400"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error401"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error403"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error404"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error409"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error429"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error503"}}},"post":{"operationId":"create_policy_rule","summary":"Declare a policy rule for a project","description":"Creates a policy rule, exactly like Settings > Policy rules. Rules encode your team's monitoring criteria; a match is a lead for review, not proof of a policy violation. From the next saved check on, each ad that breaks it opens or updates a case (one per rule and advertiser, plus the affiliate ID for affiliate rules). Earlier checks are not evaluated automatically: preview with preview_policy_rule first. Types and params: forbidden_terms {terms, fields: headline|description|display_url, applies_to, authorized_domains}; brand_term {extra_terms, authorized_domains}; direct_linking {authorized_domains}; promo_code {codes, any_explicit_code, allowed_codes, applies_to, authorized_domains}; position_limit {top_positions 1-10, applies_to, authorized_domains}; affiliate_id {authorized_ids}. applies_to is unauthorized (default for position limits) or all_non_owned (default for terms and codes). Your own domains never match, except for affiliate_id; advertisers classified as authorized retailers and authorized_domains count as authorized. A match is a lead to review: an observation shows an ad was displayed for a search at a moment, not proof of a violation, spend or a purchased keyword. Requires the write scope and an idempotency key; a retry with the same key returns the same rule.","tags":["Policy"],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":253,"description":"The project: its id, its brand domain (for example nike.example) or its exact project or brand name. Unknown or ambiguous references return not_found; call list_projects then."},"description":"The project: its id, its brand domain (for example nike.example) or its exact project or brand name. Unknown or ambiguous references return not_found; call list_projects then."},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":8,"maxLength":200,"pattern":"^[\\x21-\\x7e]+$","description":"A unique value you choose for this request, such as a UUID. Repeating the same key returns the first result instead of starting paid work again."},"description":"A unique value you choose for this request, such as a UUID. Repeating the same key returns the first result instead of starting paid work again."}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"x-required-scope":"write","x-mcp-tool":"create_policy_rule","responses":{"201":{"description":"Declare a policy rule for a project","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"created":{"type":"boolean"},"rule":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"project_id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"type":{"type":"string","enum":["forbidden_terms","brand_term","direct_linking","promo_code","position_limit","affiliate_id"]},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"readable":{"type":"boolean","description":"False when the stored configuration no longer parses; such a rule is skipped."},"params":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"terms":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":100},"maxItems":50,"description":"Forbidden words or phrases."},"fields":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["headline","description","display_url"]},"maxItems":3,"description":"Ad parts to check for terms."},"applies_to":{"type":"string","enum":["unauthorized","all_non_owned"]},"authorized_domains":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":253},"maxItems":50},"extra_terms":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":100},"maxItems":20,"description":"Extra brand terms."},"codes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":20},"maxItems":50,"description":"Forbidden promo codes."},"any_explicit_code":{"type":"boolean","description":"Also flag any other code written after the word code."},"allowed_codes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":20},"maxItems":50},"top_positions":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":10},"authorized_ids":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":256},"maxItems":200}},"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Parameters for the rule type; send only the ones that type uses."},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Parameters for the rule type; send only